cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the thesis below."
title: "Solar irradiance modeling with Unreal Engine and machine learning"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package: an Unreal Engine 5.6 project that renders a
  georeferenced 3D model of a photovoltaic rooftop, captures the hemispherical
  radiance at virtual pyranometers and integrates it into an irradiance value,
  together with a machine-learning pipeline that uses that physical simulation as
  a feature for predicting measured irradiance under partial shading.
type: software
